# AUTO's stop reasons (tools/servercheck.py, docs/ui-v2.md T23): its
# steady states are the line x = a while x < 1, with norm |x| = a; past
# x = 1 the jump leaves none nearby, so a continuation from a = 0 ends
# there without convergence (MX) unless a limit ends it before.
par a=0
init x=0
x'=a-x-5*heav(x-1)
@ total=20
done
